      "content": "That's better, but honestly, I'm looking at the dashboard and the score is still barely scraping by. If it's this low, there's a high chance it'll get bounced by the compliance team manually after it passes the auto-check, which would be a huge waste of time.\n\nCan we really push this? I need you to be much more aggressive with the disclosure. We need to really hammer home the \"warning\" and \"caution\" aspects. Go ahead and expand the section to be much more detailed regarding the specific risks. Just... try to keep it somewhat coherent, but let's prioritize getting that score well above the minimum requirements so we don't have to keep doing these revisions. We need a version that clearly hits all those keyword markers.",
